OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal owners call for more
OL,4,Afirework restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Hunter, who organised St Martin's
OL,7,FAC football club display, said the
OL,8,Fevents were a "financial boost" and a
OL,9,Ftime for community to come together.
OL,10,FThe BBC has approached the States of
OL,11,FGuernsey for comment.
